  "item_short_desc": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Guardian Tactical Shoe offers unbeatable comfort and durability on the field. The 4 inch height provides extreme flexibility during quick and rapid movements, allowing you instantly turn and pivot while in pursuit during a patrol or tactical operation. Just like our other Frontline boots, The Guardian is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, The Guardian features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Guardian Tactical Shoe offers unbeatable comfort and durability on the field. The 4 inch height provides extreme flexibility during quick and rapid movements, allowing you instantly turn and pivot while in pursuit during a patrol or tactical operation. Just like our other Frontline boots, The Guardian is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, The Guardian features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction. H2O Lock Weather Protection System: Featuring a premium&nbsp;waterproof leather and polyester upper, these tactical shoes ensure your feet stay dry, no matter the environment. The performance shoe utilizes a waterproof internal lining for added protection, with a moisture wicking mesh liner underneath for breathability while keeping water out. The gusseted tongue helps shield your foot from dirt and debris. Comfort Lock Fatigue Defense System: The molded EVA footbed and EVA midsole help absorb shock, cushioning your feet from impact while providing all-day comfort. These police shoes feature a lightweight flexible bonded construction and a nylon shank for added support and stability. Ground Lock Terrain Endurance System: These military shoes come equipped with a high grip lug rubber outsole that is non-slip and oil-resistant, allowing you to maintain your footing with enhanced grip and traction. The non-marking outsole prevents leaving scuff marks on flooring. Ready at a Moment&rsquo;s Notice: From emergency situations to scheduled patrols, these lightweight tactical shoes easily rise above the challenge. These ruggedly durable shoes are great for first responders, EMTs, security guards, public safety, active-duty personnel, tactical enthusiasts, and more. On The Frontlines: Utilizing the Lock System, each boot and shoe within Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Footwear Series is designed to tackle any job, all day, every day. From field operations to public safety, The Guardian is always ready to protect and serve.</p>",
